{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-paper-tutor#feature-1","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-paper-tutor","commit":"4e479fcc04418bc35d7bb60a98f17b6d0233eaf5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Tutor 的功能「工作区论文盘点」：扫描会话工作区并归类 PDF、LaTeX、图表、代码和数据文件。调用 paper_scan，可设置扫描根目录和递归深度，返回结构化文件清单。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2114-2127","index.js:2130-2135"]}
{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-paper-tutor#feature-2","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-paper-tutor","commit":"4e479fcc04418bc35d7bb60a98f17b6d0233eaf5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Tutor 的功能「PDF 文本与图表提取」：按页提取论文文本，可选抽取内嵌图表并匹配标题。调用 pdf_extract 并提供文件路径，可指定页码、图片目录和输出长度，结果包含页面文本及图片路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2185-2205","index.js:2220-2255"]}
{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-paper-tutor#feature-3","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-paper-tutor","commit":"4e479fcc04418bc35d7bb60a98f17b6d0233eaf5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Tutor 的功能「LaTeX 结构解析」：整理源文件中的章节、浮动图表、公式、定理与引用，并展开部分输入文件。调用 tex_structure 提供 .tex 文件或目录，返回带行号的结构大纲。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2275-2295","index.js:2320-2345"]}
{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-paper-tutor#feature-4","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-paper-tutor","commit":"4e479fcc04418bc35d7bb60a98f17b6d0233eaf5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Tutor 的功能「论文图表解读」：从 PDF 页面提取图像或读取已有图片，并可选发送至配置的视觉端点生成说明。调用 paper_figure 提供 PDF 页码或图片路径及问题；未配置端点时返回图片位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2448-2473","index.js:2488-2510","index.js:2550-2572"]}
{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-paper-tutor#caveat-1","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-paper-tutor","commit":"4e479fcc04418bc35d7bb60a98f17b6d0233eaf5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Tutor 使用前须知：配置视觉端点后，paper_figure 会将图表图片发送到该端点请求解读；视觉端点和密钥均为可选配置。见 index.js:2448-2473。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2448-2473"]}
